{"tag": "h1", "text": "Computing Science", "parent": "<div class=\"rug-panel--content\">\n<span class=\"rug-panel--content__meta\"><strong>Bachelor</strong> - full-time</span>\n<h1 class=\"rug-h2\">Computing Science</h1>\n</div>"}
{"tag": "h2", "text": "What to expect from the Bachelor's programme Computing\nScience", "parent": "<div>\n<h2>\n<strong>What to expect from the Bachelor's programme Computing\nScience</strong>\n</h2>\n\u2714 Master high-level programming in multiple languages<br/>\n\u2714 Strengthen your knowledge of mathematics, algorithms, and\ncomputational models and develop your computational thinking<br/>\n\u2714 Analyze, design, and improve software and computer systems\nfor real-world applications<br/>\n\u2714 Gain skills in system development, data analysis, and\nproblem-solving across disciplines<br/>\n<br/>\n<p>The Bachelor's in Computing Science is a three-year,\nEnglish-taught international programme. It equips you with the\ntheoretical and practical skills to design, build, and improve\ncomputer systems, covering mathematical foundations, software\ndevelopment, data analysis, "}
{"tag": "h2", "text": "Why study this programme in Groningen?", "parent": "<div class=\"rug-accordion--part\">\n<h2 class=\"rug-accordion--toggle js--analytics\" data-action=\"bachelor\" data-anchor=\"why\" data-category=\"waarom-accordion\" data-label=\"Informatica\" tabindex=\"0\">\n<span class=\"rug-icon\"></span><span class=\"rug-accordion--toggle-label\">Why study this programme in Groningen?</span>\n</h2>\n<div class=\"rug-accordion--content\">\n<a id=\"why\"></a>\n<div>\n<div>\n<p>\u2022 Comprehensive curriculum covering all major knowledge\nareas in Computing Science</p>\n<p>\u2022 Creative freedom in projects and practicals</p>\n<p>\u2022 Small-scale, personal environment for quick connections\nwith fellow students and professors</p>\n<p>\u2022 Cross-disciplinary research opportunities in fields like\nbioinformatics, medicine, and astronomy</p>\n<p>\u2022 Flexible c"}
{"tag": "h2", "text": "Programme", "parent": "<div class=\"rug-accordion--part\">\n<h2 class=\"rug-accordion--toggle js--analytics\" data-action=\"bachelor\" data-anchor=\"programme\" data-category=\"programma-accordion\" data-label=\"Informatica\" tabindex=\"0\">\n<span class=\"rug-icon\"></span><span class=\"rug-accordion--toggle-label\">Programme</span>\n</h2>\n<div class=\"rug-accordion--content\">\n<a id=\"programme\"></a>\n<nav>\n<ul class=\"rug-nav--tabs\">\n<li class=\"rug-nav--tabs__item\">\n<a class=\"js--togglable-switch js--targeted rug-nav--tabs__link\" data-toggle-class=\"rug-nav--tabs__link--active\" data-toggle-default-active=\"true\" data-toggle-group=\"course-years\" data-toggle-id=\"year-1\">Year 1</a>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</nav>\n<div class=\"rug-pt-l\">\n<div class=\"js-togglable-content\" data-toggle-class=\"js-togglable-co"}
