{"case": "aut-cs", "url": "https://www.aut.ac.nz/study/study-options/engineering-computer-and-mathematical-sciences/courses/bachelor-of-computer-and-information-sciences/computer-science-major-bachelor-of-computer-and-information-sciences", "raw_body_sha256": "1340f8a4853246291e727bfaa433ca0ba9ec31ca0fb79cb8f4b16914ffe88f0c", "metadata_sha256": "3dff64d5d03a766c27f6c33b91790ecbae91e02dfe61c76ce6a09cfc559d9c4d", "content_hash": "84048e0b9e4fd3c4548a828dd3baf7865cff197633758e601601850b83a803d7", "title": "Computer Science - Computer and Information Sciences - AUT", "class": "program_detail", "degree": "bachelor", "subject": "Computer Science Major - Bachelor of Computer and Information Sciences", "legacy_reject_reason": null, "own_h1": ["Computer Science Major - Bachelor of Computer and Information Sciences"], "own_h1_fields": [["computer_science"]], "academic_proof_existing_helper": false}
{"tag": "h1", "text": "Computer Science Major - Bachelor of Computer and Information Sciences", "parent": "<div id=\"mainContent\">\n<!-- Page content -->\n<h1>Computer Science Major - Bachelor of Computer and Information Sciences</h1> <div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-lg-9 mainLeft\"><div class=\"mb-small\">\n<div class=\"intro\"><p>Study computer science and gain the skills to develop sophisticated software solutions, solve complex problems and use the power of computing technologies innovatively.</p></div>\n<div id=\"content_container_82526_814206\">\n<p>Computer science is the study of how computers work and how they can help us solve complex problems and interact with the world around us. Computer scientists develop innovative solutions, improve existing technologies and drive technological advancements. This major is a mix of computing theory and practi"}
{"tag": "h2", "text": "Talk to us about your study options", "parent": "<div class=\"featuredPanel\"><h2>Talk to us about your study options</h2><p>Thinking about studying at AUT? Book a time with us to discuss your study options.</p><p><a class=\"btnLink\" href=\"https://www.aut.ac.nz/study/study-options/meet-us-on-campus-to-discuss-your-options\">BOOK A SESSION</a></p></div>"}
{"tag": "h3", "text": "You study the following courses:", "parent": "<div class=\"tab-pane active\" data-content=\"1\" id=\"tab-814208-1\">\n<p>The Computer Science major focuses on advanced programming, data structures, algorithm design, operating systems, computer graphics and artificial intelligence.</p><h2>Year 1</h2><p>You\u2019ll study six core courses that cover foundational computing knowledge, as well as a course on programming, covering the processes of program design and implementation using object-oriented programming.</p><h3>You study the following courses:</h3><h4>Core courses</h4><ul class=\"paperLinkList\"><li>COMP500 Programming Concepts and Techniques</li><li>COMP501 Computing Technology in Society</li><li>COMP507 IT Project Management</li><li>COMP508 Database System Design</li><li>DIGD507 Collaborative "}
{"tag": "h3", "text": "You study the following courses:", "parent": "<div class=\"tab-pane active\" data-content=\"1\" id=\"tab-814208-1\">\n<p>The Computer Science major focuses on advanced programming, data structures, algorithm design, operating systems, computer graphics and artificial intelligence.</p><h2>Year 1</h2><p>You\u2019ll study six core courses that cover foundational computing knowledge, as well as a course on programming, covering the processes of program design and implementation using object-oriented programming.</p><h3>You study the following courses:</h3><h4>Core courses</h4><ul class=\"paperLinkList\"><li>COMP500 Programming Concepts and Techniques</li><li>COMP501 Computing Technology in Society</li><li>COMP507 IT Project Management</li><li>COMP508 Database System Design</li><li>DIGD507 Collaborative "}
{"tag": "h3", "text": "You study the following courses:", "parent": "<div class=\"tab-pane active\" data-content=\"1\" id=\"tab-814208-1\">\n<p>The Computer Science major focuses on advanced programming, data structures, algorithm design, operating systems, computer graphics and artificial intelligence.</p><h2>Year 1</h2><p>You\u2019ll study six core courses that cover foundational computing knowledge, as well as a course on programming, covering the processes of program design and implementation using object-oriented programming.</p><h3>You study the following courses:</h3><h4>Core courses</h4><ul class=\"paperLinkList\"><li>COMP500 Programming Concepts and Techniques</li><li>COMP501 Computing Technology in Society</li><li>COMP507 IT Project Management</li><li>COMP508 Database System Design</li><li>DIGD507 Collaborative "}
{"tag": "h2", "text": "Study planner for this programme", "parent": "<div class=\"tab-pane active\" data-content=\"1\" id=\"tab-814208-1\">\n<p>The Computer Science major focuses on advanced programming, data structures, algorithm design, operating systems, computer graphics and artificial intelligence.</p><h2>Year 1</h2><p>You\u2019ll study six core courses that cover foundational computing knowledge, as well as a course on programming, covering the processes of program design and implementation using object-oriented programming.</p><h3>You study the following courses:</h3><h4>Core courses</h4><ul class=\"paperLinkList\"><li>COMP500 Programming Concepts and Techniques</li><li>COMP501 Computing Technology in Society</li><li>COMP507 IT Project Management</li><li>COMP508 Database System Design</li><li>DIGD507 Collaborative "}
{"tag": "h2", "text": "Ready to enrol in your courses?", "parent": "<div class=\"oldP\"><h2>Ready to enrol in your courses?</h2><p>Find out how you can enrol in the courses and classes for your programme, whether you\u2019ve just joined AUT as a new student or you\u2019re already studying with us. If you\u2019re looking for a course timetable or more info on a specific course <a aria-label=\"Link use our course search\" href=\"https://www.aut.ac.nz/study/course-search\" id=\"menur5dg\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">use our course search</a>.</p><p><a class=\"btnLink\" href=\"https://www.aut.ac.nz/student-life/studying/enrolling-in-courses-and-classes\">Enrol now</a></p></div>"}
